## 🗃️ Script de Banco (PostgreSQL)

### Tabela de Itens

```sql
CREATE TABLE items (
	id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
	code TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,
	name TEXT NOT NULL,
	description TEXT,
	type TEXT NOT NULL,
	rarity TEXT NOT NULL
);
```

---

### Consumáveis

```sql
CREATE TABLE consumables (
	item_id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY REFERENCES items(id),
	effect TEXT NOT NULL,
	value INTEGER NOT NULL
);
```

---

### Equipamentos

```sql
CREATE TABLE equipments (
	item_id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY REFERENCES items(id),
	slot TEXT NOT NULL,
	bonus_hp INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
	bonus_energy INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
	bonus_atk INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
	bonus_def INTEGER DEFAULT 0
);
```

---

### Inventário do Player

```sql
CREATE TABLE player_inventory (
	player_id BIGINT,
	item_id BIGINT,
	quantity INTEGER DEFAULT 1,
	PRIMARY KEY (player_id, item_id)
);
```

---

### Equipamentos do Player

```sql
CREATE TABLE player_equipment (
	player_id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,
	weapon_id BIGINT,
	gloves_id BIGINT,
	boots_id BIGINT,
	ring_id BIGINT,
	amulet_id BIGINT
);
```

